      "description": "Fixed-column rows; state is glyph + word + mono ref, flagged row in plum.",
      "html": "<table class=\"ds-rows\"><thead><tr><th>Bank line</th><th class=\"a\">Amount</th><th>Matched to</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Stonebridge Flooring</td><td class=\"a\">1,240.00</td><td class=\"s\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.6l3.6 3.4L13.5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>Invoice <code>INV-0418</code></td></tr><tr class=\"f\"><td>FPS M Okafor</td><td class=\"a\">&minus;600.00</td><td class=\"s\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M3.5 14.5V2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M3.5 2.5h8.2l-1.9 3 1.9 3H3.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>No match <code>&middot; 2 possible bills</code></td></tr></tbody></table>",
